  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Seeking Justice for Survivors 2023-2025 Belarus and Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to strengthen civil society to enhance access to Mental Health and Psychosocial Support (MHPSS) and justice and redress for survivors, and to pursue accountability for perpetrators of torture, war crimes, and related international crimes and human rights violations committed in the Ukrainian and Belarusian contexts.
DIGNITY is implementing partner.</narrative>
  </description>
